Source: @PKG@
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Docker Hardened Images <dhi@docker.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
 libssl-dev,
 pkg-config,
 python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://valkey.io

Package: @PKG@-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: valkey-tools, redis-tools
Conflicts: valkey-tools, redis-tools
Replaces: valkey-tools, redis-tools
Description: Valkey command-line interface and utilities
 Valkey is a high-performance data structure server that primarily serves
 key/value workloads over the RESP (Redis serialization) protocol. Created as a
 community fork of Redis 7.2, it is wire- and configuration-compatible with
 Redis.
 .
 This package provides the client-side tools valkey-cli and valkey-benchmark,
 with redis-cli / redis-benchmark compatibility symlinks.

Package: @PKG@-server
Architecture: any
Depends: @PKG@-tools (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: valkey-server, valkey, redis-server
Conflicts: valkey-server, redis-server
Replaces: valkey-server, redis-server
Description: Valkey server (RESP-compatible key/value datastore)
 Valkey is a high-performance data structure server that primarily serves
 key/value workloads over the RESP (Redis serialization) protocol. Created as a
 community fork of Redis 7.2, it is wire- and configuration-compatible with
 Redis.
 .
 This package provides valkey-server and the valkey-check-rdb / valkey-check-aof
 helpers, with redis-server / redis-check-* compatibility symlinks so consumers
 that invoke the server as redis-server continue to work.

Package: @PKG@-sentinel
Architecture: any
Depends: @PKG@-server (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: valkey-sentinel, redis-sentinel
Conflicts: valkey-sentinel, redis-sentinel
Replaces: valkey-sentinel, redis-sentinel
Description: Valkey sentinel high-availability monitor
 Valkey is a high-performance data structure server that primarily serves
 key/value workloads over the RESP (Redis serialization) protocol. Created as a
 community fork of Redis 7.2, it is wire- and configuration-compatible with
 Redis.
 .
 This package provides valkey-sentinel (the failover monitor), with a
 redis-sentinel compatibility symlink.
